Weekly Summary

Week 1: HTML Fundamentals
- I learned how to make the basic structure of a webpage using HTML. I used headings, paragraphs, links, images, and lists.
Week 2: Semantic & Multimedia
- I learned how to use different HTML tags to organize a webpage. I also added images to the webpage.
Week 3: CSS Basics
- I learned how to use CSS to make my webpage look better. I added colors,fonts, spacing, bo9rders, and background.
Week 4: JavaScript Basics and DOM Manipulation 
- I learned how to use JavaScript to make my webpage iteractive. I practiced using variables, functions, buttons, and changig webpage content.
Week 5: JavaScript Functions and Bootstrap
- I learned more about JavaScript functions and how to use Bootstraps. I used Bootstrap to make my webpage more organized and responsive.
Week 6: API & Client Storage
- I learned how to get data from an API and use it on my webpage. I also learned how to save data using Local Storage.
Week 7: MiniFullStackStarter
- I created a simple full-stack system using the skills I learned from the previous weeks. I worked with the frontend, backend, API, and database.

